// Whether to speak TLS (HTTPS) to UploadReplayDataHost/Port instead of plain HTTP. Defaults
// to off to match the historical direct-IP:5000 server, which only ever spoke plain HTTP -
// flipping this default would break uploads for everyone already using that setup. Needed
// for hosts fronted by Cloudflare (e.g. a domain on port 443): Cloudflare's proxy expects a
// real TLS handshake on 443 and returns "400 The plain HTTP request was sent to HTTPS port"
// otherwise - confirmed via tools/test_replay_upload.ps1 against replays.blazqueue.com.
SETTING(bool, uploadReplayDataUseTls, "UploadReplayDataUseTls", "0");
